: "Nice to meet you rei! Thank you for your appeal.\nPlease let me make a request!\n\nCould you draw a character from the browser game \"Alice Mystiria! I would like to draw a character from the browser game \"Alice Mystiria!\n\nPlease feel free to draw the character you would like to draw the most in both composition and costume.\nPlease feel free to draw the character you would like to draw the most in both composition and costume.\nYou can find some full-length portraits of the characters in the [Sacred Costume] button on the character page.\nYou can see some full-body portraits of the characters in the \"Sacred Costume\" button.\n\nhttps://dmm-imys.com/character/\n\nOfficial guidelines for Airis Mystiria\nhttps://august-soft.com/about/fanfic_guideline/\n(To summarize, Aimis is officially allowed to create derivative works.\n　You can skip this section if you like.)\n\nThank you for your consideration of the above.", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@rei_yuri0/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1437016, "client_id": 869883, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bb66e225/uploads/origins/19417b36-05ae-4ab3-b6fb-038d5d4e6965?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f0ac55e515bf82841848117169f5ccc7", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bb66e225/uploads/origins/19417b36-05ae-4ab3-b6fb-038d5d4e6965?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f0ac55e515bf82841848117169f5ccc7, https://si.imgix.net/bb66e225/uploads/origins/19417b36-05ae-4ab3-b6fb-038d5d4e6965?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1e300190f86dd61a848917426748a2a6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bb66e225/uploads/origins/19417b36-05ae-4ab3-b6fb-038d5d4e6965?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=11438b648d5